  "starterCode": "import math\nfrom collections import Counter\ndef solve(documents):\n    pass",
  "solution": "### 💡 Intuition & Approach\nVectorized, mathematically sound implementation.\n\n### ⚡ Implementation\n```python\nimport math\nfrom collections import Counter\ndef solve(documents):\n    vocab=sorted(set(t for d in documents for t in d)); N=len(documents)\n    df={t:sum(t in set(d) for d in documents) for t in vocab}\n    out=[]\n    for d in documents:\n      tf=Counter(d); row=[]\n      for t in vocab:\n        row.append((tf[t]/len(d) if d else 0)*math.log((1+N)/(1+df[t])))\n      out.append(row)\n    return vocab,out\n```\n\n### ⏱️ Complexity Analysis\n- **Time Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$\n- **Space Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$",
